{"id":"horrible","lemma":"horrible","pos":"adj","rank":610,"glosses":["horrible (causing horror)","horrible (very bad)"],"ipa":"/oˈrible/","forms":{"femininePlural":"horribles"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bd/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-horrible.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tienes un aspecto horrible.","en":"You look awful.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/41656"},{"text":"He hecho un montón de cosas horribles.","en":"I've done a lot of horrible things.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/435768"},{"text":"Tu aspecto es horrible.","en":"You look horrible.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/567195"},{"text":"Las condiciones sanitarias en los campamentos de refugiados eran horribles.","en":"Sanitary conditions in the refugee camps were terrible."},{"text":"Tengo un dolor horrible.","en":"I have a terrible pain.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/79809"}]}